Z||000022||AusFiero||08-10-2001||09:15 AM||||In Photoshop it can be a combination of hue/saturation, color balance and also adjusting brightness/contrast. Hue/saturation alone will not give you enough variety and can in a lot of cases lose realism. Also a high res picture helps as it keeps the colour better. That picture I used is just an enlarged one off Archies webs site. Also the main thing is to keep what you want to change as a seperate layer so you can just duplicate the layer and play with it in many different ways. Note the painted areas only have been kept below.<BR>Turn on another modified layer with the edges of everything missing and you get colour change without edge blockiness.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/lt1.008.jpg"> <P><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.auto-alley.com" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||1
Z||000023||MinnGreenGT||08-10-2001||09:31 AM||||The only color that is really difficult (if not impossible to make appear real) is Black.  It just never quite looks right!||||reg||1
Z||000024||Archie||08-10-2001||11:07 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by AusFiero:<BR><B>In Photoshop it can be a combination of hue/saturation, color balance and also adjusting brightness/contrast. Hue/saturation alone will not give you enough variety and can in a lot of cases lose realism. Also a high res picture helps as it keeps the colour better. That picture I used is just an enlarged one off Archies webs site. Also the main thing is to keep what you want to change as a seperate layer so you can just duplicate the layer and play with it in many different ways. Note the painted areas only have been kept below.<BR>Turn on another modified layer with the edges of everything missing and you get colour change without edge blockiness.<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Wow, I think you lost me there....<P>Thanks, now all I gotta figure out is how to do layers.<P>Attention 87GTbro, all my EMails to you keep bouncing, your server thinks I'm sending spam. <P>Archie||||reg||1
